          GAINS – R‑Style Graphics & Linear Regression
        </motion.h1>

        <p className="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">
          Upload a CSV and build Line, Bar, Pie, Histogram, or Scatter plots. Optional simple
